    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Although enclosed containerized carriers offer the highest level of protection, they also come with an additional cost compared to open trailers. Packers and movers might charge a premium for this service.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<h3>Open Trailers</h3>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 18px 0;">
