  <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Open Trailers:</strong> These carriers are more cost-effective but carry a higher risk of damage due to weather exposure and road conditions. They are suitable for less-expensive items, shorter distances, and good weather conditions.</span></li>
